{"id":"34436320","title":"画“农”为“家”！一年一度，温情直播→","published_at":"2026-11-08T11:19:00+08:00","published_label":"2026-11-08","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBDwtku3Q9Zcszia9NB34jm1p3p1mwhzhaUvpI1IFHICicJrGe4xPfxeNm5FTQVib3FbFHMdpuMdqicXGKzic44T095Ad9ASFX5owhc/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"这个周末 秋光澄澈，暖意洋洋 华农2026年秩年校友返校日活动 温情举行 来自五湖四海的校友重返校园 忆过往，启新篇 广东华南农业大学校友会 第七次校友代表大会","tags":["人物","活动"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/T9kKeH8w1v9GObUR9wZbAA","paper_url":"https://m.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_34436320","word_count":3311,"fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:02:23+08:00","content_html":"<div><section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=3775337430061121543&amp;scene=126&amp;sessionid=#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc9QsnuJkkicicTEx009DOveoUmVgORmyG7pI63efCbQBaQiaN5jZqakiaXXmz2cT68dwvRdibQ7MXVgz5g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><p><span>这个周末</span></p><p><span>秋光澄澈，暖意洋洋</span></p><p><span>华农2026年秩年校友返校日活动</span></p><p><span>温情举行</span></p><p><span>来自五湖四海的校友重返校园</span></p><p><span>忆过往，启新篇</span></p><p><span>广东华南农业大学校友会</span></p><p><span>第七次校友代表大会隆重召开</span></p><p><span>理事会、监事会完成换届选举</span></p><p><span>首届“竹铭春晖奖”致敬校友大爱</span></p><p><span>“华农优品”校友企业产品展人气满满</span></p><p><span>还有一系列温馨多彩的活动</span></p><p><span>吸引了广大校友的热情参与</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/MVPvEL7Qg0GiavibMXLrgj7FgQ5J23B6XC2U2CuPHIIO83tlibUA8r9qrWOI0X9f73IQDwEtPkuYGTHEOURwS1CHQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>校友会第七次会员代表大会</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>暨理事会、监事会换届选举大会</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/MVPvEL7Qg0GiavibMXLrgj7FgQ5J23B6XC2U2CuPHIIO83tlibUA8r9qrWOI0X9f73IQDwEtPkuYGTHEOURwS1CHQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCs7VTuHXRq5J1KibhUrz5bDIXNWZ0adoHdXEiaLZkGS8wr1zF8OYOGpDE2PJmXYouO8bkWS7ydP9rxRAKzzEIj8OEh4iao0mnL4I/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span>大会现场</span></p><section><span><span>图书馆报告厅里，广东华南农业大学校友会第七次会员代表大会暨理事会、监事会换届选举大会正在举行，来自海内外各地与行业校友组织代表、校友企业家代表，以及学校领导、教师代表齐聚一堂，共叙母校情、共话校友梦。</span></span></section><section><span><span>校友会第七届理事会、第二届监事会召开了第一次会议，依照程序选举产生了理事会会长、副会长、秘书长及监事长。</span></span><span><span>校长薛红卫当选广东华南农业大学校友会第七届理事会会长；</span></span><span><span>原校长陈晓阳被聘为名誉会长；</span></span><span><span>王文博等32人当选副会长。</span></span></section><section><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCWnGWO7mpfpYDibsLWdB04pmWo7l3JFFVcDeb9UIYo5hFxic7VkDJiazfbvjvhmg5ZgFvZzt91MkLFkS1LaI4a1HhNibN8YAaDuDc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAegAzM7rbhYd9LicfNKAiaCh4PnSdibPwXl0wFMGG08ic33AxhXfkRccj3Rd9ndqz49fdIPxF8OvG5vB0ARDvNFLLHdXPAooC4fiaU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDUWTicnZXYkFWxny20tQbJXB2HUfQ1Rpm4wvpIKOgVmPjCqc322u4hyOJIicfyYfOTeEWQYiciakciagQlsW7V0wL5Z1hQKN5v44w0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCNXgg1AIXSTqw0f0aQpOmpdIQxSPLGXZvc583XuN10FUXoHX9pjjQRVfoYic0kIvjVPm610lFfakia3AcNNmzYickWuJCMN6Vzb4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAKhGsfaUzcq8sqmezpb86DFyPrQLFRb5ibr3lwdtNXBMFe37FSd0wWfXzt6QdX0ibT3fBzwsI75ibwJT5w1PATEqbVZuPIEEYicds/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBUmQMYeRrYhkpLZFVj3yLv3ZufFNl96bwU2LCbpf8r33fVa8oNAdK3u2LJlhiaHjiaTMOaKkVS5BlDXvJQy0w9uVV1W61YoEzds/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><span>“校友是母校永远的牵挂，也是推动学校事业发展的重要力量。”华农党委书记李凤亮向海内外广大校友致以诚挚问候，对第六届理事会及各界校友长期以来支持学校建设发展表示感谢。他指出，广大校友在各行各业实干建功、反哺母校，捐资助学蔚然成风，校友情怀历久弥新，希望校友会新一届理事会夯实组织根基，拓宽服务网络，汇聚资源智慧，将校友工作转化为“战略支撑”，构建母校与校友双向奔赴的发展共同体，围绕学校“双一流”建设，深化校友企业“小巨人”成长计划，携手书写校友与学双向赋能、共创未来的新篇章。</span></span></section><p><span><span>“希望各位理事发挥所长、各展其能，积极牵线搭桥、凝心汇智，共同为母校与校友发展聚势赋能、添砖加瓦。”校长薛红卫表示，校友会是连接母校与广大校友的重要桥梁纽带，希望新一届校友会坚持规范治会，夯实制度根基，聚焦赋能发展，促进校企科技成果转化，打造校友经济新生态，以情感为桥，擦亮品牌活动，着力服务大局，彰显华农人使命担当，共助学校“双一流”建设，为建设农业特色世界一流大学、助力农业强国建设贡献华农力量。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDR7LwvXnIJsOFQwcFaNTkInTvvxfZiaWx7dDwXro35RmzjG2enUnZHHFkuFF2asq8bT0pibcrO5VZic5YPad9bjOrXLwBN6Driaibk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDr5XAxlX1Zx3PibYAm3y5hgM4zfFIQCRttbQbcPL8jeH0tn4pAR5n6x361Sjq0icctDbZU3l11BjX0MIOic1KjeO93VyuamibLJfU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBpNjR4fpvSiayGPGIXXNGEXLvFRKHyK2uAW25nN5vzUqovDhOg6ohtyTLnYuysz1icibH5omMEaoXUBV4cemppiadvyYF8C0Aj1mE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAhVxtcNxfpSvgBW78eT9QcDoTB6lLXRyzec0lqXhA3lVxpyqax36SuVAs4qzTiacSYaOnH7ek4WoXMHriaY31ibkictkOzQMsw7Rs/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>华南农业大学首届校友工作“竹铭春晖奖”颁奖仪式上，一批校友联络、校友服务工作中表现突出的集体与个人上台接过牌匾和奖杯。</span>深圳市华南农业大学校友会<span>、动物科学学院校友会作为获奖集体代表，湛江校友会会长王京作为获奖个人代表分享了校友工作经验感悟，表示将继续深耕校友联络服务，凝聚更多校友力量反哺母校发展。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDCAGQT7Uc9dDUOtyDKbpEMI6LHZIUcmYMmXqDD97YGk3d1CAMib989nzyicLsfp2YXQPRhfrUagSpqvtqm6G44jU192ZCpN2fYs/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAZCheicLVQtib6h4OXzYxuNLcFhUZjpppWGw8ZbhiacvLc7ydpPJqicLLwJwaiaxey8JXlvynaSaibgDxxVdVSfbIcibFOvfuPfLlib6U/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBMwYia5KPGzsLkXLHnoZBpDZ5ia1JxYqNpBzGhfyhWpr4fJmK38QNenicUQlribNwkv0NHRJQQkeNibgat5DgDXEkywwV8r1GkY9yw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>一批优秀校友受聘“校友导师”，将发挥校友资源优势，赋能在校学生成长成才。会上，大连锂工科技有限公司向学校捐赠了一批进口自动化设备，助力学校教学科研平台建设。</span></span></p><p><span><span>会议还审议通过了校友会第六届理事会工作报告、校友会第一届监事会工作报告。</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>秩年相聚启新篇</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>缤纷活动叙农情</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCW3ACjKKXZlJWdQXGiaNIHlG2ib9pMXqPONuSbpAdqNMUJhuDrK6sbKicxFMH4NlNJGdf8qS2u9eTicZmYmibWFlsL3XHGAFeGr29A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCeLWTamibjsibs5mc3mcQk3Z6Py1OsQDyRcEicMumCuNBGDbUicWdtaAoGaBCgDsKavwslBlrcuQCYZlFbqF8OAh3Nb6fkalTuwV8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><p><span>今年，“流苏飞扬・我与母校合个影”“校史流芳・参观校史馆、农博馆”“师恩难忘・共叙母院情怀”“品味时光・重温华农味道”等返校日活动继续开展，“华农优品・校友企业产品展”、大众篆刻作品展等特色活动引人注目。</span></p></section><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCJuE7cYJic15lBo31wEcAGWxm6pUuEa6WNUbPlFtsBX3XaDfhCjmFhUNflsdl3nx3l3MboszXFKF5zFJqIlYL6enVN7vNz7TrU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><section><p><span>各学院也积极联络校友，结合学校办学117周年及学院实际，推出一系列形式多样、内容丰富、各具特色的主题活动。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/T2yibzMo9C8T9iaOMDribUmdez1GFV0r4AeIibTBc9pibQ2mtn69j1icCKciaQeSEwXH76ryTwUNqZIMUkzIglNKYpuicw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>华农优品·校友企业产品展</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>竹铭草海上热闹非凡，第五届校友企业成果展暨华农优品·头雁企业产品展正在举行。来自各行各业的华农校友携绿色农产品、食品饮料、文创好物与各类科技转化成果重返母校，既展示奋斗昂扬风貌，也搭建服务乡村振兴和“百千万工程”的产品交流平台。</span></p></section><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckA9tYzr2vxSmibSU7xO1yqFqm5qia2hk5AEqAeXKZOaJG7nVNA5wY2Af37CNmPAThDRia7a5mLYYxWv6AHbyEbQxcX28MlouH3SrM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCX6XCupvpB4nqQIL0ZZ9Dun64UzP7NEUjZDA6bqr5ggbQTNoH3KxT0dvygiado53GRCyFXhXeYRlFiaJvSrsqZQkmWIqEib6vU2k/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCBbmssR8Aib2Wzbtr4slIGQlia86rVJlMeOCMeGbickyzdiajb3ZHZgRHkQQ9yNPiasuqUNbzebU1q0xFRchQk4Y8JypICCMNCLyxA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBT09kNm7Bx5L3bMNfic89g4kCF424tc2IktB16JgQKNBr8HlsPcvAJP8ZBkiaMqo6oN0TuIAqO4YMoPOQbfneA8IvuykIr4XQl4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><p><span>“我们是化州人，家门口就种了很多化橘红树，而沉香产业则是从父辈传承至今。”2022届头雁班学员、2023届头雁班导师林喜宁携化橘红、沉香系列深加工产品前来。他表示，头雁班培训期间，华农专家给予的技术扶持有效帮助自己的公司提质增效，希望未来可以与母校更加紧密合作，推动产学研结合。</span></p></section></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBLkDrKVGoHFCGs7xSeHaLWCjXZcdTIribI6zy73SyjmMwIXpMITaLo2rxw0icLsl1OtBg9mAZ2NmYuFT20ndm5FkI4ORQTgS7k4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><p><span>“华农的茶学必须是我的首选，这里是最专业也是最值得我来的地方。”出身五代茶叶世家，园艺学院2024届茶学专业秦琳珊带十余款香型凤凰单丛参展。本科就读中山大学的她，因对茶学的热爱，专程来到华农进修茶学，其所在企业也与茶学专业开展合作，为学子提供学以致用的实践平台。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/T2yibzMo9C8T9iaOMDribUmdez1GFV0r4AeIibTBc9pibQ2mtn69j1icCKciaQeSEwXH76ryTwUNqZIMUkzIglNKYpuicw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>师恩难忘·共叙母院情怀</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBE59IM6Klj1WlFMdx6N7aUKfrOU2r0nhWVpAicVK6VOPMIS1RZkmoichbujdd7UCcBTlZgibW9kEr8aNLic4PpgznnfPnHHiaZmXT8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBneuX7AvB3YDsJrtAqgibPiaj7KNnG6R4Oj0dMVdVxeK88Aj5w6TkEwJibXEibPTm34PiaRTKwZZPtAicEsKkajG62zIAXObl1HaH9k/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDgjKIgwhgXxlnKiaEd5VDbf9NHV8ZMuEuibiaCNCjkUicpxmYPCNpbjf6VtlFfo3478GkJ4picicIdq1BI9Ofwa2KuFkYHfKkBdWIIs/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span>各类富有学科特色和校友情怀的学院活动为返校日增色不少。植物保护学院开放昆虫博物馆，带领校友探索奇妙虫趣；工程学院举办师生重逢主题班会，组织参观水稻机械化博物馆；人工智能与低空技术学院集齐篮球、足球、羽毛球、乒乓球多项球赛，同步发起返校最美照片征集、三行情书征集活动；人文与法学学院推出汉服体验打卡、传统礼仪节目展演，让返校之旅热闹又暖心。</span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCahEv68uI2ibANAPl7VHO7yA5JR9xKsMiahBaYiaRbvibaM9zjs5qGwuA6Wd30JbibMV7uGcYfnfS9PXqWM1Sew8xV3dFqLqKc4vkQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDwTBgdSNJvZXILwic7oGf4S54wsAYicohibm7P1C0vTUdFzakYvbpd8Uic6RTubicxBic32lk4FcctwNIDwsIEb8cR4FfRH6OjytibRM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span>本次返校日活动上，宁荫湖上的可爱“状元鸭”、竹铭草海和湾区设计与艺术学院院楼前的“兔爷”成为新晋“打卡”点。据介绍，这些文创艺术装置由学院校友捐赠展出，为校友参与设计创作作品，寄托了对学弟学妹们平安顺遂、学业有成、节节高升的美好祝愿，将持续展出至12月中下旬。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/T2yibzMo9C8T9iaOMDribUmdez1GFV0r4AeIibTBc9pibQ2mtn69j1icCKciaQeSEwXH76ryTwUNqZIMUkzIglNKYpuicw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>流苏飞扬·我与母校合个影</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCSjHJ9URvdSu9FmycYd92zgoGIUJfHNWtVSU5yrOfjfN37CjQSbUjZAvY2Uw6wknXs2pmQyDMAciae2QSnAChp8Xrgp7Zg8BSE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBgpDWiatzmibdicZO8wwfIEgMTzCVuln85VBUaiaB9tnaWBHMCIK8ukaST4auBr7gUMDUJEibkGJe46ZQwQpFb4ErKZhDUNexnYXMc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAcBaN0NatQAZXhPf38F708I12dVBRWicg2icJUX5K9o14tAr2amUsNUCJiapL5D9GuXWwQhjnbLlc5FD4wBDaDRicD6V2WELxosn0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAt3zG9CpbzBiaMRtRLkOyOQKrS0PLBzaj4PZX5WAiby6fdrVy4HWwBHia7wuAUWSqNkfy1Bk8b2FmfUQXibEiavB2lkCHWqTcxA44k/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><p><span>重回青春故里</span></p><p><span>往日的记忆扑面而来</span></p><p><span>镜头定格</span></p><p><span>留下和母校的合影</span></p><p><span>珍藏这次重逢</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/T2yibzMo9C8T9iaOMDribUmdez1GFV0r4AeIibTBc9pibQ2mtn69j1icCKciaQeSEwXH76ryTwUNqZIMUkzIglNKYpuicw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>校史流芳·参观5号楼、农博馆</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckB9TTELj6rkKEy2KkqgiarcDSBWZ7IlKkyWcYudaXgZwnljD0Fl0ucPNYt50ensJl7MOJDZqCnANYSgZrXRVmTMLppjib441Fphk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCTWm7cQjFgJWiah7PIozQgN0S2cGNP30Dv0OtX14iajaibrFCj3nE6NIGyp7HG2ken1hyrY948c5GnGG3JUJsE6Mj7M7ReLUibO4Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDszFjADr7vQbYTc9SXiayUusk2IMtib5A02iaW1DdVbbk2EEDYjT0aZKkAKoicVia96ToCjL9ZUPm9t9O0YPOcXrfKhRkUAkcG0NwQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><p><span>目光抚过馆藏</span></p><p><span>细读漫漫长卷</span></p><p><span>知农信念历代传递</span></p><p><span>校史馆内追随先人脚步</span></p><p><span>重温跨越时光的初心</span></p><p><span>农博馆中携老友、亲眷之手</span></p><p><span>回忆求学岁月的珍贵时光</span></p><p><span>在大众篆刻展中</span></p><p><span>以方寸天地，看见悠悠校史</span></p><p><span>照见美好未来</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/T2yibzMo9C8T9iaOMDribUmdez1GFV0r4AeIibTBc9pibQ2mtn69j1icCKciaQeSEwXH76ryTwUNqZIMUkzIglNKYpuicw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>品味时光·重温华农味道</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCEa1ASu7T6HMY897Miavc05k2SnichyAlayyqNzRnoibw39zMOTMhxPOVibYiavgx7UMQAz9Vs2vpxWib6Kv2E9cIwR80gOIticC3dHA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCqQ22bHFgdveMzre1K6nn7nWeg6lkmC4UCKxOEhMZkJ1QfFl2aUiawPLP5Tlr3vp3gnOqzG0fibFrbL3vSXzrmibGdDIsNEiaOd3Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDYMw9XGl02DMajC1gqXy8epbXvsbNlWiamCdibXPbLnKB66Tz9xGAoffEmUWeMDc4eadtDrlrl33CZYURHUDbYmrezDYiamGtmz4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><p><span>重返熟悉的饭堂</span></p><p><span>时光仿佛按下回放键</span></p><p><span>在饭菜香里回忆求学岁月</span></p><p><span>在欢声笑语中重温同窗情谊</span></p><p><span>变的是焕新的模样</span></p><p><span>不变的是那一份情怀</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>归有期，情如故：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>华农再聚，他们这样忆芳华……</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDZVl4AxqsCsznYA1WAXKmvwuhibPwPW9Jy6gIEKyB5ykCgGFRsVmiaJksibPDETGMtM9SF1G8NftdN9zkaibEOOTzmEcp5ibAnJcfM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><p><span>“当年特别荣幸，卢永根院士给我们上第一节遗传学课，他的太太徐雪宾教授则为我们讲授生理学课程。”在卢永根先进事迹陈列展馆内，农学院1976届遗传选种系校友蔡洪光与同窗驻足观看展陈内容。他深情说道：“如今阔别五十载，再次相聚华农，我们格外欢喜，大家关系特别亲密。回望求学岁月，当年我们投身育种研究，为粮食问题尽一份力量，得益于母校的栽培。所以无论走多远，我们的根，始终在华农。”</span></p></section></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckC7gcRojtYIdBMvy5X5kPiaCpVFDk7tyCjbGF71frBJvZzRJazt1QON5rS9URTicWvyWkAvdLM7O5bywEuQGhNlWQcZlUG8euz7Y/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><p><span>紫荆小巴在农博馆门口缓缓停靠，工程学院1976届农机系的校友们陆续走下车来。今年是他们毕业50周年，大家约定要把记忆里的路重走一遍。</span></p><p><span>“一走进母校，就感觉特别亲切。”自称是“老大姐”的邹慧芸笑着说道。谈及当年的大学时光，她满怀感触：“能够获得上大学的机会，这段经历深深影响了我们，时至今日，能够拥有华农求学的这段过往，我们依旧倍感自豪。”</span></p></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDrVBI9icWf9tljPWC9C6bWQhOPhiakicK7ZicOdkwfN4RZZHA5VnOBPlzWl41yOvqfiav9QHoOkkR9OpTOr6roVyltF6AVRRsf4qwo/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><p><span>“13年没回来了，发现母校变化很大！”一大早，食品学院2008届食品质量安全专业的梁媛萍携家人到农博馆参观，也让孩子提前“预习”一下大学的生活。在校期间，充实的专业实践、多彩的社团活动、亚运会志愿服务，以及找到了专业对口的工作，都让她记忆犹新。梁媛萍感慨：“在华农，我收获了很多成长历练的机会。校园面貌日新月异，但母校助力学子成长的初心始终不变。”</span></p></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBQwoZVx2CMnV7f74uLptuDn8fuianPep17bD1hJ1ib39NWR91LSQRstNnNw2dT4EoWcqia5AdvYv284MKIqzW0ibFn5cqJqWurxbg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><p><span>农情隽永，初心如故</span></p><p><span>岁月匆匆</span></p><p><span>愿那份少年时光</span></p><p><span>始终是你生命美好的难忘过往</span></p><p><span>愿那段青春记忆</span></p><p><span>始终是你值得回味的动人乐章</span></p><p><span>母校始终在这里</span></p><p><span>等待与你的下一次重逢</span></p><section><section><p><span>亲爱的校友们，欢迎回家！</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBGGRbYoc2jNyJiaQQt6Eic9kNMeVFGE0iaTDrgKtVYD7VIVoRyfeE6sf23jPF2Lur4j7ktLwnssaUFr38Gude7AicXeRDhwl9dR9I/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span>往期回顾</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652901719&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=7ee91300fb3dc253c0284895eab15e9a&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn